To find the average (mean) of your last five purchases:

\[
\text{Mean}= \frac{\sum_{i=1}^{5}\text{amount}_i}{5}
           = \frac{45.99 + 78.25 + 102.50 + 38.75 + 92.10}{5}
           = \frac{357.59}{5}
           = 71.518
\]

So, the average spend across those five transactions is **$71.52** (rounded to two decimals).
